{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with our integrative practice to ask questions, request intake info, or schedule a conversation.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfd; --ink:#102028; --muted:#6b7b83; --accent:#6b9f59; --accent-2:#7a7af5; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --card:#ffffff; --radius:14px; --shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16,32,40,0.08);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%; margin:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg, #f9fbfc 0%, #ffffff 60%); color:var(--ink);}
    /* Inline svg background sits behind everything */
    #bgPattern{position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:-1; width:100%; height:100%; pointer-events:none; opacity:0.22}

    header{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:18px; padding:22px 28px; max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto}
    .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px}
    .logoMark{width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2)); display:grid; place-items:center; color:#fff; font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:12px; color:var(--muted); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600}
    .hero{max-width:1200px; margin:28px auto 0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 420px; gap:28px; padding:0 28px}
    .card{background:var(--card); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:22px; box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .lead{font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin:0 0 8px}
    .sub{color:var(--muted); margin:0 0 16px}

    form .row{display:flex; gap:10px}
    input[type="text"], input[type="email"], textarea, select{width:100%; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #e6eaee; background:transparent; font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px; resize:vertical}
    .btn{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2)); color:white; padding:10px 14px; border-radius:10px; text-decoration:none; border:0; cursor:pointer}
    .mutedSmall{font-size:13px; color:var(--muted)}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px}
    .testimonial{min-height:96px; transition:opacity .45s ease, transform .45s ease}
    .t-author{font-weight:700; color:var(--ink)}
    .badgeRow{display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:8px}
    .badge{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f6f7fb); border-radius:8px; padding:6px 8px; font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); border:1px solid #eef2f7; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; position:relative}
    .badge .dot{width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent)}
    .tooltip{position:absolute; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); bottom:calc(100% + 10px); background:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:8px 10px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); white-space:nowrap; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); display:none}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{display:block}

    /* Pricing comparator micro */
    .comparator{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; padding:12px; border-radius:12px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#fbfeff); border:1px solid #eef3f6}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex; gap:6px; align-items:center; padding:6px; border-radius:999px; background:#f1f5f8}
    .toggle button{background:transparent;border:0;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px; cursor:pointer}
    .toggle .active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2)); color:white}
    .pricePanel{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:baseline}
    .price{font-size:20px; font-weight:800; color:var(--accent-2)}
    .small{font-size:12px; color:var(--muted)}

    footer{max-width:1200px; margin:32px auto 80px; padding:0 28px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center}

    @media (max-width:960px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr; padding:0 18px}
      header{padding:14px 18px}
      nav{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- background svg pattern -->
  <svg id="bgPattern" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f0f8f7" />
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ffffff" />
      </linearGradient>
      <pattern id="p1" width="120" height="120" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <rect width="60" height="60" fill="#f3faf7" />
        <rect x="60" y="60" width="60" height="60" fill="#f3faf7" />
        <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="6" fill="#e8f3e9" />
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="8" fill="#eef8ff" />
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" opacity="0.75" />
    <g opacity="0.25" transform="translate(40,80)">
      <path d="M0,100 C80,20 220,20 320,100 L320,260 L0,260 Z" fill="url(#g1)" />
    </g>
  </svg>

  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logoMark">HM</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">A companion approach to unmet health questions</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="about.html">Team</a>
      <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="hero">
    <section class="card">
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 6px">Let's find a practical next step together</h1>
      <p class="sub">Reach out with questions, tell us the context, or book an initial conversation. We focus on usable plans that fit your life.</p>

      <form id="contactForm" class="mutedSmall" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); handleSubmit();">
        <label class="mutedSmall">Your name</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Jane Doe" required>
        <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label class="mutedSmall">Phone</label>
            <input type="text" id="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label class="mutedSmall">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <label class="mutedSmall" style="margin-top:10px">What's on your mind?</label>
        <textarea id="message" placeholder="Brief context, priorities, and any access needs"></textarea>

        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-top:12px">
          <div class="mutedSmall">Prefer a call? <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call us</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div>
            <button class="btn" type="submit">Claim Your Intro Seat</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>

      <hr style="margin:16px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eef2f6">
      <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between">
        <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center">
          <div class="mutedSmall">Serving:</div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center">
          <a class="mutedSmall" href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
          <a class="mutedSmall" href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside style="position:relative">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="mutedSmall">Popular quick tools</div>
        <h3 style="margin:8px 0">Proof Gallery</h3>
        <div class="proof" aria-live="polite">
          <div id="testimonial" class="testimonial">
            <p id="tText" style="margin:0; font-size:15px">""</p>
            <div style="margin-top:8px"><span id="tAuthor" class="t-author"></span> — <span class="mutedSmall" id="tRole"></span></div>
            <div class="badgeRow" id="badgeRow"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:12px">
          <button class="btn" id="prevBtn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--accent-2);border:1px solid #eef3f6">Previous</button>
          <button class="btn" id="nextBtn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--accent-2);border:1px solid #eef3f6">Next</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="height:16px"></div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="mutedSmall">Compare simple plans</div>
        <h3 style="margin:8px 0">Pricing comparator</h3>
        <div class="comparator">
          <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Billing cycle">
            <button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Monthly</button>
            <button id="packageBtn" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Package</button>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1; display:flex; justify-content:flex-end; align-items:center">
            <div class="pricePanel">
              <div class="price" id="priceVal">$120</div>
              <div class="small">/ visit</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mutedSmall" style="margin-top:8px">Toggle to see a package that lowers visit cost and includes focused planning.</div>
      </div>

      <div style="height:16px"></div>

      <!-- small duplicate comparator (micro variant) -->
      <div class="card">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center">
          <div>
            <div class="mutedSmall">Micro compare</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Intro Cycle</div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:right">
            <div class="price" id="priceMini">$95</div>
            <div class="small">per session</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px; display:flex; gap:8px; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center">
          <button class="btn" id="miniToggle">Show package</button>
          <div class="mutedSmall">Save when you purchase 4 or 6-session cycles</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="mutedSmall">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Questions? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    <div class="mutedSmall">Ready to chat? <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Utilities
    function qs(sel){return document.querySelector(sel)}
    function qsa(sel){return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(sel))}

    // Proof Gallery data
    const testimonials = [
      {text: "The care team helped me connect the dots — practical steps I could try within days.", author: "A. Rivera", role: "Teacher", badges:[{label:"Research Collaboration", tip:"Contributed to a community research registry."},{label:"Clinic Affiliated", tip:"We partner with local allied providers."}]},
      {text: "We built a plan that fit my schedule and budget; the follow-up kept it realistic.", author: "M. Chen", role: "Engineer", badges:[{label:"Peer Reviewed", tip:"Protocols align with evidence summaries."},{label:"Telehealth", tip:"Secure video visits available."}]},
      {text: "I appreciated concrete tracking tools and coaching that felt human, not clinical.", author: "R. Alvarez", role: "Freelancer", badges:[{label:"Outcome Tracking", tip:"We measure progress with simple metrics."},{label:"Education", tip:"Courses and guides are included in plans."}]}
    ];

    let tIndex = 0;
    const tText = qs('#tText');
    const tAuthor = qs('#tAuthor');
    const tRole = qs('#tRole');
    const badgeRow = qs('#badgeRow');
    const testimonialEl = qs('#testimonial');

    function renderTestimonial(i){
      const t = testimonials[i];
      testimonialEl.style.opacity = 0; testimonialEl.style.transform = 'translateY(6px)';
      setTimeout(()=>{
        tText.textContent = '"' + t.text + '"';
        tAuthor.textContent = t.author;
        tRole.textContent = t.role;
        badgeRow.innerHTML = '';
        t.badges.forEach(b=>{
          const bEl = document.createElement('div'); bEl.className = 'badge';
          bEl.innerHTML = '<span class="dot" aria-hidden></span>' + b.label + '<span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">'+b.tip+'</span>';
          badgeRow.appendChild(bEl);
        });
        testimonialEl.style.opacity = 1; testimonialEl.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
      }, 260);
    }

    // Auto rotate
    let rotTimer = setInterval(()=>{ tIndex = (tIndex+1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(tIndex); }, 5200);
    qs('#nextBtn').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ clearInterval(rotTimer); tIndex = (tIndex+1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(tIndex); rotTimer = setInterval(()=>{ tIndex = (tIndex+1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(tIndex); }, 5200); });
    qs('#prevBtn').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ clearInterval(rotTimer); tIndex = (tIndex-1+testimonials.length) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(tIndex); rotTimer = setInterval(()=>{ tIndex = (tIndex+1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(tIndex); }, 5200); });

    // Initial render
    renderTestimonial(0);

    // Pricing comparator
    const monthlyBtn = qs('#monthlyBtn');
    const packageBtn = qs('#packageBtn');
    const priceVal = qs('#priceVal');

    const prices = { monthly: 120, package: 85 }; // per-visit presentation

    function animateNumber(el, from, to, ms){
      const start = performance.now();
      function step(now){
        const t = Math.min(1,(now-start)/ms);
        const v = Math.round(from + (to-from) * (1 - Math.cos(Math.PI * t))/2); // ease
        el.textContent = '$' + v;
        if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(step);
    }

    monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      monthlyBtn.classList.add('active'); monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');
      packageBtn.classList.remove('active'); packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
      const now = parseInt(priceVal.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''))||prices.package;
      animateNumber(priceVal, now, prices.monthly, 550);
    });
    packageBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      packageBtn.classList.add('active'); packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');
      monthlyBtn.classList.remove('active'); monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
      const now = parseInt(priceVal.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''))||prices.monthly;
      animateNumber(priceVal, now, prices.package, 550);
    });

    // Mini comparator
    const miniToggle = qs('#miniToggle');
    const priceMini = qs('#priceMini');
    let miniState = 'session';
    miniToggle.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      if(miniState==='session'){
        animateNumber(priceMini, parseInt(priceMini.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''))||95, 70, 500);
        miniToggle.textContent = 'Show single session'; miniState='package';
      } else {
        animateNumber(priceMini, parseInt(priceMini.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''))||70, 95, 500);
        miniToggle.textContent = 'Show package'; miniState='session';
      }
    });

    // Contact form placeholder behaviour
    function handleSubmit(){
      const name = qs('#name').value || 'Friend';
      const email = qs('#email').value;
      const m = qs('#message').value;
      // Simple feedback — not sending anywhere
      const original = qs('#contactForm').innerHTML;
      qs('#contactForm').innerHTML = '<div style="padding:18px"><strong>Thanks, '+name+'!</strong><div style="margin-top:8px" class="mutedSmall">We received your note. A member of our team will respond to '+(email? email : 'your email')+' shortly.</div></div>';
      setTimeout(()=>{ qs('#contactForm').innerHTML = original; }, 4700);
    }

    // Footer year
    qs('#year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Accessibility: pause rotation when user focuses testimonial
    qsa('#testimonial, #prevBtn, #nextBtn').forEach(el=>{
      el.addEventListener('focus', ()=>{ clearInterval(rotTimer); });
      el.addEventListener('blur', ()=>{ rotTimer = setInterval(()=>{ tIndex = (tIndex+1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(tIndex); }, 5200); });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact Page & Microfeatures

This bundle contains two files for the contact page chunk of a holistic/integrative medicine site.

Files included:
- contact.html — the full contact page with local CSS and JavaScript. It includes interactive micro-features:
  - Proof Gallery: rotates testimonials, shows credibility badges with hover tooltips, keyboard focus pauses rotation.
  - Pricing Comparator: a monthly vs package toggle with smooth animated numbers.
  - Micro comparator variant for a compact pricing display.
  - Contact form (local, non-submitting) that provides inline acknowledgment.

- README.md — this file (you are reading it).

Placeholders
- The HTML uses placeholders that should be replaced by your templating system or by search/replace:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

How to use
1. Drop contact.html into your site root or a test folder alongside the other site pages.
2. Replace placeholder tokens with real values or let your server-side template engine inject them.
3. Open contact.html in a browser. The Proof Gallery rotates automatically; you can also use Prev/Next.
4. Use the Pricing Comparator buttons to toggle prices and watch the number animation.

Notes
- No external assets or fonts are used. Visual texture comes from an inline SVG pattern.
- The contact form is a front-end demo and does not send data to a backend. Replace handleSubmit() with real submission logic to integrate with your service.
- The testimonials and pricing data are inlined in the page's script for simplicity; adapt as necessary.

Accessibility
- The testimonial rotation pauses when relevant elements are focused for keyboard users.
- Tooltips are shown on hover and available to screen readers as they are DOM elements included in the badge markup.

License / Attribution
- This code is provided for your project. No third-party dependencies.

Enjoy! If you need variants (modal scheduling flow, server hooks for form submission, or CSV export for leads), ask and I can extend this chunk."}
BUNDLE_END
